cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StrokeSmriti, please cite it as below."
title: "StrokeSmriti: a multilingual, offline, clinician-administered assessment of cognitive outcomes after stroke and stroke procedures"
abstract: "Free tablet tool for measuring cognition after stroke, thrombectomy, thrombolysis and carotid or intracranial revascularisation in India. Eight languages, read-aloud instructions, pointing versions for aphasia and limited literacy, three parallel forms, procedure-anchored timepoints, and process measures. Research use only; not yet validated."
